n  extremely elaborate plan with decoys and  a training montage and even I literally  scripted out fake scene and this is  where the title comes in often in the  pages of a script kind of like what  Cisco maybe wrote for this barry and  linda scene you indicate the entrance of  a character with the word enter like  Vader enters or when they're building it  up even more  something like someone's saying okay I  get it you're going out with a famous  person but they can't be that famous you  could write Enter Pope Francis it's a  way to imply that a character of great  importance is entering the scene and is  about to change everything so the title  both applies to the fact that zoom  enters this cute little scene that  they've scripted out as part of their  trap and then the other meaning is  actually a little meta because it's also  the case in this script for the overall  flash episode like the writers wrote in  all this planning in the silly montage  and then in the script for the episode  at this moment when zoom is gonna come  in and absolutely change everything you  better believe they wrote Enter zoom  also smaller thing to note about the  title this was the most badass villain  we've ever seen on the show  he destroyed Barry worse than anything  we've ever seen terrified me and I know  that he's a fictional character and yet  this was just enter zoom like we're just  getting started with him holy [ __ ]  this guy's gonna be insane but here my  lingering thoughts and some other  observations I had the previews made it  look like dr. light is the biggest dummy  she just like runs into a metal pole oh  and also if you're wondering where earth  to dr. light Lynda is they don't tell us  so as far as we know she is still  walking around Central City butt-naked  it's also fun to remember that Linda  Park isn't the original doctor light  Linda's TV show and I don't just mean  the fact that they recast the part from  the reporter that showed up in the pilot  I mean that Cisco and Caitlin actually  referenced an old employee named dr.  light that made a gun that Cisco uses  against destro  back when we first met these people on  arrow to put them belong to Arthur bite  Wells fired him two years ago watch  because he was a psycho so this is dr.  light too also it was pretty unclear if  the speed dampener had any effect on  zoom but if it didn't I think that's a  hint that like in the comics zoom isn't  actually a speedster his powers work in  a completely different kind of mind  [ __ ] way but we'll see if they do  that right after lying about his  blindness before I wonder how Barry's  gonna explain to Patti why he's  paralyzed from the waist down you can't  say he got his legs dilated also anybody  else wondering how they're gonna change  Barry's voiceover next episode  considering his current condition my  name is Barry Allen and I've got the  fastest wheelchair around by the way we  can joke about this because the arrow  already showed us and that flash forward  that Barry's gonna be fine all right  some questions for you guys one do we  think earth one's Oliver Queen is gonna  meet earth twos Robert Queen and are we  could have like a father-son double  arrow team-up which by the way is  definitely a pitch for an arrow TV movie  I want credit on that I'm getting  distracted the question is do you think  it's gonna happen and Oliver Queen  Robert Queen team-up also question two  I'm really loving the cross-dimensional  earth-2 flashbacks and it reminds me of  how major portions of arrow episodes are  told through flashbacks as well so how  would you guys feel if those became a  regular part of the flash episodes for a  while what do you think finally question  3 do you think our Barry is going to  travel to earth - and if so is he gonna  meet Doppel Barry I would love that  because then maybe you'd have to work  with him kind of like how Olivia did on  Fringe but do you think that's gonna  happen all right so that's it for this  in-depth analysis of flash season 2  episode 6 enter zoom and between you and  me we're trying really hard to get these  videos out to you quickly without having  to sacrifice too much of the analysis so  bear with me if I'm a little late  sometimes thank you  and it would really help us out a lot if  you spread the word that we're doing  these because I really like doing them  and I would love for other fans of the  shows to join us on this super nerdy  conversation so share this video with  your friends if you like to also check  out my Walking Dead analysis video if  you watch that show it has some really  good examinations of gory blood imagery  but check that out I'm Phil Molina hit  me up on Twitter at fimo and follow at  new rockstars to find out when her  videos are posting and what else  of going on I will see you in an agent  of shield video or an arrow video or a  Walking Dead video or all of the videos  on the Internet this has been fun bye
 

